From ea9fe2553da9f5cef35feb3d368ce74ca3f06306 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 21:23:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] perf(ui): group welded faces once per feature set for the
 pick chips

model::patches and model::patch_rings memoize the welded-face grouping
by the Arc<Features> allocation (the chain_memo key). The pick chips and
pick::face_origin (chips, 3-2-1 check) read the memo; face_origin finds
a patch's strips with a binary search in the sorted face list. Display
and pick targets only: answers equal a fresh grouping.

Pinned by model::patch_memo::tests, the probe's patch counter (0 on a
still frame in states a-e) and
frame_cost_caches::pick_chips_group_the_welded_faces_once_and_follow_the_picks.

Fixes #2247

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
